{"unit_id":"heyuanliu3-byte__dsh-auto-preset#card-zh","repo":"heyuanliu3-byte/dsh-auto-preset","commit":"8c0847fc8db629730ed233a62202581b1db40f2a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-preset 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话权限预设插件。它监听会话中的权限预设事件，将用户最后一次手动选择保存到本地状态文件，并在重新打开会话时恢复仍然可用且与当前值不同的预设。首次打开时不会覆盖系统默认值；插件恢复自己保存的值时也会忽略相应事件，避免当作新的手动选择。状态文件默认位于插件目录旁，也可通过 DSH_AUTOPRESET_STATE 指定路径。适合希望不同会话在重启后继续使用各自权限预设的用户，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:28-49","lib/index.js:64-115"]}
{"unit_id":"heyuanliu3-byte__dsh-auto-preset#card-en","repo":"heyuanliu3-byte/dsh-auto-preset","commit":"8c0847fc8db629730ed233a62202581b1db40f2a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-preset remembers each DSH Web session's last manual permission preset. It saves choices locally and restores an available choice when a session reopens, leaving first openings at the system default. DSH_AUTOPRESET_STATE sets the state file path. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:28-49","lib/index.js:64-115"]}
