{"unit_id":"heyuanliu3-byte__dsh-auto-preset#feature-1","repo":"heyuanliu3-byte/dsh-auto-preset","commit":"8c0847fc8db629730ed233a62202581b1db40f2a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-preset 的功能「记录手动选择」：会话进入已初始化状态后，监听 permission/preset 事件并保存该会话最后选择的预设和更新时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:64-79"]}
