{"unit_id":"heyuanliu3-byte__dsh-auto-preset#feature-3","repo":"heyuanliu3-byte/dsh-auto-preset","commit":"8c0847fc8db629730ed233a62202581b1db40f2a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-preset 的功能「本地持久化」：将会话选择保存在 JSON 状态文件中，默认使用插件目录旁的 state.json，也可用 DSH_AUTOPRESET_STATE 自定义位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-49"]}
